project (k, n) (rows≈2 cost≈384)
└─ aggregate keys=[c.k] aggs=[count_0=count] (rows≈2 cost≈352)
   └─ project (c.k) (rows≈2 cost≈320)
      └─ filter (! (call qdb_is_null k)) (rows≈2 cost≈304)
         └─ project (k) (rows≈5 cost≈264)
            └─ filter (> |i.v| 0) (rows≈5 cost≈224)
               └─ source i AS i row-groups (> |i.v| 0) (rows≈7 cost≈112)
